<mxCell id="txt21" value="&lt;b&gt;MediCitas — entity-relationship model (Stage 1, OLTP)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=22;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="30" width="1400" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="txt22" value="Physical model of the four PostgreSQL 18 databases, one per microservice. Every tenant table carries &lt;b&gt;clinic_id&lt;/b&gt; as the first column of its primary key and is protected by RLS (FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="66" width="1700" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="txt23" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt; primary key &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt; foreign key enforced by PostgreSQL &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;UQ&lt;/b&gt; unique (&lt;b&gt;UQ*&lt;/b&gt;: unique together with clinic_id)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;LR&lt;/b&gt; logical reference to another table, usually in another database: no FK across services; the owning service checks it. Shown in &lt;font color=&quot;#1f5fa8&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;blue italics&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Solid line&lt;/b&gt;: FK inside one database. &amp;nbsp; &lt;font color=&quot;#1f5fa8&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Dashed blue line&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: main logical references across databases.&lt;br&gt;Not drawn, to keep the picture readable: every &lt;b&gt;clinic_id → clinic&lt;/b&gt;, every &lt;b&gt;created_by / cancelled_by / status_changed_by → app_user&lt;/b&gt;, clinical_note.professional_id and professional_service.specialty_id.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ends: &lt;b&gt;||&lt;/b&gt; exactly one, &lt;b&gt;o|&lt;/b&gt; zero or one, &lt;b&gt;o&amp;lt;&lt;/b&gt; zero or many.&lt;br&gt;Italic lines under a table: constraints and triggers the engine enforces (I1-I6 are the invariants of the statement)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#fafafa;spacing=12;rounded=1;arcSize=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1600" width="2370" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
